        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I&#39;ll answer what I can of 2 and 3</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>2. &nbsp; It&#39;s basically open play that can use any combination of heroes and villains on either side. &nbsp; Phantaskippy listed some scenarios to use in skirmishes that you should look at. &nbsp;</p><p>3. &nbsp;Omni Reaper doesn&#39;t have a character deck so he couldn&#39;t be used in Skirmishes. &nbsp;I guess you could play him if you wanted but you&#39;d be severely handicapped</p>",
